<</Author(Nazrul Islam)/CreationDate(D:20090601131256Z)/Creator(Advanced PDF Repair: http://www.pdf-repair.com)/Keywords(The book is written is in easy-to-read style with corresponding examples. The main aim of this book is to precisely explain the fundamentals of Tensors and their applications to Mechanics; Elasticity; Theory of Relativity; Electromagnetic; Riemannian Geometry and many other disciplines of science and engineering; in a lucid manner. The text has been explained section wise; every concept has been narrated in the form of definition; examples and questions related to the concept taught. The overall package of the book is highly useful and interesting for the people associated with the field.)/ModDate(D:20090601131340+08'00')/Producer(Advanced PDF Repair: http://www.pdf-repair.com)/Subject(Mathematics, Physics)/Title(Tensors & their Applications )>>
